...
18 | q A :- area (square 4) A. (*~ E0504 *)
   |              ^^^^^^^^ `square 4` would be built as an input of `area`
   |
   = note: `square` is a fact constructor (`%fact`): building `square 4` makes it a fact of `square`, and a moded call builds its inputs as demands, so `%mode` would change the database
   = help: if `square` is only used as a value, remove `%fact` from its declaration
   = help: otherwise bind an existing fact first and pass the variable, e.g. `S = square 4` before the call

